input.old_string:
/// Whether this Mac should advertise `computer_use` and poll fast enough to
/// claim device actions within the gateway's ~60s wait window. The advertise
/// and poll-interval predicates must stay identical.
/// `computerUseEnabled` is intent ("the user switched this on"), NOT capability.
/// It used to be OR'd with the live preflights, so once set it advertised
/// `computer_use` even when macOS granted nothing — and the server happily
/// dispatched clicks to a Mac that could not click. Measured on the Mac mini
/// 2026-07-30: the `permissions` operation reported Screen Recording,
/// Accessibility and Event Synthesizing all `false` while the device row still
/// carried `computer_use`. TCC binds these grants to the app's code signing
/// requirement, so any re-signed build silently drops them while System
/// Settings keeps showing the toggle on — exactly when a stale flag lies
/// loudest. Advertise only what the OS actually grants right now.

input.new_string:
/// Whether this Mac should advertise `computer_use` and poll fast enough to
/// claim device actions within the gateway's ~60s wait window. The advertise
/// and poll-interval predicates must stay identical.
///
/// Live OS preflights only. `computerUseEnabled` is intent ("the user
/// switched this on"), NOT capability, and it used to be OR'd in here — so
/// once set, this Mac advertised `computer_use` even when macOS granted
/// nothing, and the server dispatched clicks to a Mac that could not click.
/// Measured on the Mac mini 2026-07-30: the connector's `permissions`
/// operation reported Screen Recording, Accessibility and Event Synthesizing
/// all `false` while the device row still carried `computer_use`. TCC binds
/// these grants to the app's code signing identity, so a re-signed build
/// silently loses them while System Settings still shows the checkbox on —
/// exactly the moment a cached intent flag lies loudest. `computerUseEnabled`
/// keeps its `didSet`, which restarts the poll timer so a fresh grant is
/// picked up immediately.

